-as-us-israel-unleash-heaviest-strikes-on-iran-as-tehran-rules-out-ceasefire/articleshow/129426206.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-11T04:59:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129426358,imgsize-758527.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Did Sakura Shymko move on with Kick streamer Drago after JasonTheWeen breakup? Viral yacht kiss clip leaves fans confused]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129426060.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A viral yacht kiss video made many viewers believe Sakura Shymko was dating Kick streamer Drago soon after her breakup with JasonTheWeen. However, streamer community accounts and community notes later clarified the woman in the video was actually a lookalike. Sakura Shymko and Drago have not commented, and there is currently no confirmed connection between them.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/did-sakura-shymko-move-on-with-kick-streamer-drago-after-jasontheween-breakup-viral-yacht-kiss-clip-leaves-fans-confused/articleshow/129426060.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/did-sakura-shymko-move-on-with-kick-streamer-drago-after-jasontheween-breakup-viral-yacht-kiss-clip-leaves-fans-confused/articleshow/129426060.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-11T04:48:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehjal Gupta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129426018,imgsize-830732.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[At least six dead, five injured in Switzerland bus fire]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129421452.cms" /&gt;<![C